{"parse": {"title": "谋杀始于清晨-04", "pageid": 110539, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%8B%E6%9D%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8-02\" title=\"谋杀始于清晨-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">谋杀始于清晨-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%8B%E6%9D%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8-06\" title=\"谋杀始于清晨-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">谋杀始于清晨</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A5.9E.E5.9C.A3.E4.B9.8B.E8.B7.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"神圣之路\">神圣之路</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 神圣之路</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Sacred Way</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_dibao1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_dibao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>敌人对福兰第二火线区的轰炸还未结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>碎石不断滚落，在身上磕出岩石碰撞的声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>昏聩之时，身躯为她做了万全的保障，帮她将血肉转换为坚硬的“铠甲”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我居然睡着了……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在炮击中久违地入梦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>懵懂片刻，隧道内难以忍受的恶臭让她彻底清醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>污泥与尸体的腐臭、排泄物的腥臊和野战炮的硝烟味道，再次占领嗅觉的高地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>哼，玛丽你可睡得真香啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>谁能想到半年前你还是听到枪声就会打颤的新兵蛋子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她并不理会来自战友的调侃，浑身的瘙痒折磨着她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>该死的跳蚤……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>捏死恼人的生物，玛丽安娜摸向怀里的书信，暗自喘了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>能睡也好，毕竟我们又要回到“死人山”了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>我们已经来后方休整了三个多月，是不是明天就要回前线了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>西蒙的声音发着颤，但清晰地传至玛丽安娜耳中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……我不知道，“圣路连”的确还不能离开前线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>但司令承诺过这里的战役结束后我们就能回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这支神秘学家连队，以战役中起到关键支援作用的公路为名，承担着难以实现的期望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抵达前线半年里，他们已折损了半数兵力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但这只是庞大伤亡人数中微不足道的数字，神秘术也未能解救陷入堑壕战的前线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>哈！终结拉锯，扭转战局，征兵宣传赋予我们多么伟大的使命！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>可没人说在取得胜利前我们会渴死！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>敌军的火力摧毁了后方补给，导致他们近一周都在忍耐饿与渴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>战士们多少还能靠隧道里遗留的罐头与压缩饼干度日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>口渴却无可奈何，他们甚至不得已舔舐潮湿岩壁上渗出的水滴解渴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……我已向皮埃尔中士申请，炮击结束后我会去找水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>上帝保佑！你知道哪有水吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>弗朗瓦索听见了水流的低语，他说隧道外八百米有一处洼地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>天啊，我听说过……那里是轰炸的重点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>我知道你的神秘术是存活性最大的，但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>圣路连已经牺牲了太多人，我不想你也……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惨痛的现实让玛丽安娜一时恍惚，她竭尽全力地吞咽自己的颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……我们别无选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>没有水，可能我们真的会在这里渴死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你也说了我的神秘术很能保命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜自嘲地笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>弗朗瓦索也会去，这样带回水的几率高些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……再等等吧，炮击马上就结束了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身着深蓝制服的士兵，蹲在洼地旁动作利落地盛水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说是洼地，也如坟场，无人收殓的身躯裸露在野外，水壶散落一地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜撇开水面上的绿色浮沫，泡胀的尸体在漾开的水纹间轻微摇动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗朗瓦索：</div><div>水……太臭了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……总好过喝排泄物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵们沉默不语，同时想起了因缺水而发生的骇人事件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>敌人知道我们会常来这找水，再快些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗朗瓦索：</div><div>该死！怎么就开始了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>快找掩体躲避！！</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜蜷缩在低矮的小山坡下将自己石化起来，耳边已听不见弗朗瓦索的呻吟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无数弹片从“铠甲”上弹开，炸飞的枯枝残叶与泥土兜头浇下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘术再度让她幸运存活，却也再一次让她目睹战友的逝去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在战争的怪圈中，她一遍又一遍地为死亡见证其残酷。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_dibao1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_dibao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_dibao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">西蒙：</div><div>……也许明天就要回前线了吧？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_dibao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_dibao2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_dibao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-3_0_bg_dibao2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_dibao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-3_0_bg_dibao2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_dibao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-3_0_bg_dibao2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_dibao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-312614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>不……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……我不愿再回到那个地狱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-312611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>神……我祈求你原谅我的过错……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……唔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>荒野无人，唯有至高的神与无情的炮火见证两枚弹片嵌进了本应坚硬的腹部。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>亲爱的艾格尼丝，原谅我现在才给你写信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>此时我正在福兰城养伤，不用担心，我已快痊愈了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>为了寻找水源，我们付出了巨大的代价，我也是在这过程中负的伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>我竭尽全力带着水返回了营地，却无法带回战友的遗体……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>不行……军队会检查信件，这样写艾格尼丝就收不到了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……也不能用谎言染指艾格尼丝的幸福……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜靠坐在简易病床上，焦虑地拍了拍脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她划掉涉及找水的内容，重新斟酌了措辞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>听说关键堡垒成功收复，想必这场漫长的拉锯快要结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>我们坚守了阵线，让首都免受战火的蹂躏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>这也意味着我马上能回家了，希望新来的司令会信守承诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>上次来信你说你正忙于救济无家可归之人，你的善良总是令我动容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>但你身体是否康健？家里的情况如何？我会日夜为你们的平安祈祷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传令兵：</div><div>泰内布朗热，这是你的命令信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>圣路连……是不是可以回家了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传令兵的表情微妙，眼神中似乎带有一丝怜悯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传令兵：</div><div>你看了就清楚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她期待而惶恐地接过这张薄薄的纸，打开纸张的手微微颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命令信：</div><div>泰内布朗热二等兵，得医生告知，你的伤病期即将结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命令信：</div><div>鉴于“圣路连”在战场上的英勇表现，以及神秘术在战场上的作用——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命令信：</div><div>司令部认为，接下来的关键攻势依旧需要你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命令信：</div><div>请在三天后归队。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "谋杀始于清晨-04"}}